<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/8 (FIM 257.99).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/8 (FIM 257.99).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $0-1/2 to $57-1/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 257.99 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday Nokia A closed up 6.00 markka at 259.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose $0-1/8 to $32-3/8 on Wall Street on Wednesday. The price equals about 73.11 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 1.00 markka to 74.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR fell $0-1/8 to $18-7/8 in New York. The price equals about 85.24 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 1.00 markka lower at 86.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
